---
const base = `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/+$/, "")}/`;
---
<section class="statstrade-surface-study" aria-label="Statstrade feed and world exploration">
  <header>
    <p>Two surfaces · one product model</p>
    <h2>The feed is home.<br />The world is entered.</h2>
  </header>

  <div class="statstrade-surface-study__grid">
    <article class="statstrade-feed-study">
      <div class="statstrade-study-bar">
        <img src={`${base}favicons/statstrade.svg`} alt="Statstrade angular red S" />
        <strong>Statstrade</strong><span>Feed</span>
      </div>
      <div class="statstrade-feed-layout">
        <aside>
          <small>Communities</small>
          <b>r/AFL</b><b>r/Formula1</b><b>r/NBA</b><b>r/PoliticsAU</b>
        </aside>
        <main>
          <p class="statstrade-post-meta">r/AFL · LIVE · 03:14 remaining</p>
          <h3>Does Carlton score the next goal before the 12-minute mark?</h3>
          <p>Territory has shifted, but the last two exits were intercepted. The crowd is moving toward yes.</p>
          <div class="statstrade-market"><strong>YES 67</strong><i><span></span></i><button type="button">Enter arena</button></div>
          <footer><span>18.4k conviction</span><span>486 comments</span><span>Save</span></footer>
        </main>
      </div>
      <p class="statstrade-study-note"><strong>Everyday surface</strong><span>Fast, text-first, community-led, and useful without WebGL.</span><a href={`${base}concepts/statstrade/feed/`}>Open feed concept →</a></p>
    </article>

    <article class="statstrade-world-study">
      <img src={`${base}statstrade/assets/arena-night-study.svg`} alt="Night study of the human Roman civic arena used by Statstrade" />
      <div class="statstrade-world-study__veil"></div>
      <div class="statstrade-world-study__title"><small>WORLD / LIVE</small><strong>The Arena of Conviction</strong></div>
      <nav aria-label="Arena camera bookmarks"><span>Threshold</span><span>Tribune</span><span>Arena floor</span></nav>
      <p class="statstrade-study-note"><strong>Spatial surface</strong><span>The same posts and markets become places, standards, markers, and camera destinations.</span><a href={`${base}concepts/statstrade/arena/`}>Open arena concept →</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .statstrade-surface-study {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100vw - 3rem));
    margin: 2rem 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
  }

  .statstrade-surface-study > header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 190px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .statstrade-surface-study > header p {
    color: #c52337;
    font: .6rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace);
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .statstrade-surface-study > header h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
    font: 400 clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 4.8rem)/.98 "Marcellus", Georgia, serif;
  }

  .statstrade-surface-study__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--visual-line, var(--sl-color-hairline));
    border: 1px solid var(--visual-line, var(--sl-color-hairline));
  }

  .statstrade-surface-study article {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 560px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #f2eee7;
  }

  .statstrade-study-bar {
    min-height: 58px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: .7rem;
    padding: .7rem 1rem;
    color: #171415;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #d4cbc1;
  }

  .statstrade-study-bar img { width: 32px; height: 33px; }
  .statstrade-study-bar strong { font: 600 1.05rem "Marcellus", Georgia, serif; }
  .statstrade-study-bar span { margin-left: auto; color: #6f6565; font: .58rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout { min-height: 430px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout aside { display: grid; align-content: start; gap: .75rem; padding: 1rem .8rem; color: #51494a; background: #e5dfd5; border-right: 1px solid #d0c5ba; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout aside small { color: #761321; font: .52rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout aside b { font-size: .7rem; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout main { padding: 1.35rem; color: #171415; }
  .statstrade-post-meta { margin: 0; color: #9e1726; font: .55rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); letter-spacing: .06em; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout h3 { margin: 1rem 0 .7rem; font: 600 clamp(1.4rem, 2.4vw, 2.1rem)/1.08 "Marcellus", Georgia, serif; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout main > p:not(.statstrade-post-meta) { color: #5a5152; font-size: .82rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .statstrade-market { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: .7rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 1.2rem; padding: 1rem; color: #fff; background: #180d10; }
  .statstrade-market strong { color: #ff7278; font: 700 .7rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); }
  .statstrade-market i { height: 7px; background: #4b3034; }
  .statstrade-market i span { width: 67%; height: 100%; display: block; background: #c52337; }
  .statstrade-market button { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-height: 38px; color: #fff; background: transparent; border: 1px solid #9f4650; font: 700 .56rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .statstrade-feed-layout footer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .7rem; margin-top: 1rem; color: #776d6e; font-size: .64rem; }
  .statstrade-study-note { position: absolute; inset: auto 0 0; display: grid; gap: .25rem; margin: 0; padding: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(125, 94, 88, .24); background: rgba(242, 238, 231, .94); }
  .statstrade-study-note strong { color: #761321; font: .58rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .statstrade-study-note span { color: #5a5152; font-size: .72rem; }
  .statstrade-study-note a { margin-top: .35rem; color: #9e1726; font: 700 .53rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); letter-spacing: .08em; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .statstrade-world-study { color: #fff; background: #070507 !important; }
  .statstrade-world-study > img { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; object-fit: cover; }
  .statstrade-world-study__veil { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5,3,5,.1), rgba(5,3,5,.64)); }
  .statstrade-world-study__title { position: absolute; top: 1.2rem; left: 1.2rem; display: grid; gap: .45rem; }
  .statstrade-world-study__title small { color: #ff777d; font: .55rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .statstrade-world-study__title strong { max-width: 440px; font: 400 clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem)/.95 "Marcellus", Georgia, serif; }
  .statstrade-world-study nav { position: absolute; right: 1rem; bottom: 7rem; display: flex; gap: .35rem; padding: .35rem; background: rgba(7,5,7,.72); border: 1px solid rgba(255,119,125,.22); }
  .statstrade-world-study nav span { padding: .55rem .65rem; font: .53rem var(--sl-font-mono, monospace); letter-spacing: .07em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .statstrade-world-study nav span:last-child { background: #9e1726; }
  .statstrade-world-study .statstrade-study-note { color: #fff; background: rgba(9,6,8,.9); border-top-color: rgba(255,119,125,.24); }
  .statstrade-world-study .statstrade-study-note strong, .statstrade-world-study .statstrade-study-note a { color: #ff777d; }
  .statstrade-world-study .statstrade-study-note span { color: #cbb9b8; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .statstrade-surface-study > header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .5rem; }
    .statstrade-surface-study__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .statstrade-surface-study article { min-height: 560px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .statstrade-surface-study { width: min(100vw - 1.5rem, 1180px); }
    .statstrade-feed-layout { grid-template-columns: 84px 1fr; }
    .statstrade-feed-layout aside { padding-inline: .55rem; }
    .statstrade-world-study nav { left: 1rem; right: auto; }
  }
</style>
